    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n47058" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">surreptĭo</span></b>  (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">subr-</span></b> ),
		ōnis, f.
		id., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a
				stealing</i>, <i>purloining</i>, <i>theft</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">surreptionem factitasse,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">App. M. 10, p. 245, 32</span></i>
			: per surreptionem elicere, i. e. <i>by
			deception</i> or <i>subreption</i>,
